<title>USA: Managed Care to receive investment.</title>
<headline>Managed Care to receive investment.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Managed Care Solutions Inc said it has signed a letter of intent with Blue Cross and Blue Shield of Texas Inc under which Blue Cross may invest $3.0 million into Managed Care in the form of a convertible loan.</p>
<p>The proposed loan will have an interest rate of eight percent, payable at the end of the initial three-year term. It is convertible into the Company's common stock at $3.85 a share.</p>
<p>Blue Cross also will receive a warrant to purchase 100,000 shares of Managed Care's common stock at $4.45.</p>
</text>
